cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GDCGenomicsQC, please cite the versioned software release.
type: software
title: 'GDCGenomicsQC: Reproducible Ancestry-Aware Genomic Quality Control in Controlled-Access Computing Environments'
abstract: >-
  GDCGenomicsQC is a configuration-driven Snakemake workflow for genomic
  quality control and ancestry-aware preprocessing in controlled-access
  computing environments. It supports genotype conversion, genome-build
  harmonization, sample and variant quality control, relatedness assessment,
  reference-projected principal component analysis, and global ancestry
  classification. Public synthetic test materials support independent
  inspection and validation of the documented workflow paths.
